00:02:21.980 --> 00:02:22.480
Are we going to exchange
Mile One with AP-12?

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:24.780
Well, yes, with things being
how they are now.

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:29.990
A truck's on its way from Gowa's
research facility, with the unit.

00:02:29.990 --> 00:02:30.620
